Error [E0968]: `nixos-24.05` isn't a `target@provider` source ref or bare path
  --> env.jet:3:25
    |
  3 |     sources: { default: nixos-24.05 }
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: D-JPK-REF1 puts the upstream target before `@` and its provider after it; local `./`, `../`, and `/` paths stay bare
 Fix: write `NixOS/nixpkgs/nixos-24.05@github`, `nixos-unstable@nixpkgs`, or a bare path such as `../local`
